      "body": "## Summary\nAdd Python scheduling and graph algorithms for the TaskFlow test application.\n\n## Changes\n- Heap-based priority scheduling\n- Repeated-sort reference implementation\n- BFS and DFS graph traversal\n- Directed cycle detection\n- 11 unit tests\n\n## Validation\n- pytest\n- Ruff\n- GitHub Actions\n\n## SAMANVAYA evaluation\nCheck whether static algorithm discovery correctly identifies traversal and scheduling patterns.\n\nCompare verified implementation evidence with advisory algorithm interpretations.\n\nNo benchmark performance claims are made in this PR.",
